{"id":"96725962b9ae69ca","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-tree11-pruned-subtree-core.md","title":"ZFC Tree11 Pruned Subtree Core","display":"df-zfc-tree11-pruned-subtree-core — ZFC Tree11 Pruned Subtree Core","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-pruned-subtree-core","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-pruned-subtree-core"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-pruned-subtree-core — ZFC Tree11 Pruned Subtree Core","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree10-pruned-tree]]","[[58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-pruned-subtree-core"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-pruned-subtree-core</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-pruned-subtree-core — ZFC Tree11 Pruned Subtree Core"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd5bb3c18fda356a\" href=\"?note=cd5bb3c18fda356a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree10-pruned-tree\">58-df-zfc-tree10-pruned-tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"336078cd2c28561e\" href=\"?note=336078cd2c28561e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree\">58-df-zfc-tree8-subtree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T,R,t,u\\in V\">\\(S,T,R,t,u\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PrunedTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PrunedTree}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11PrunedSubtreeCore}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11PrunedSubtreeCore}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}pruned\\text{-}subtree\\text{-}core} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11PrunedSubtreeCore}_S(S,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PrunedTree}_S(S)\\land\\forall R\\subseteq T\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(R,T)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PrunedTree}_S(R)\\to R\\subseteq S\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}pruned\\text{-}subtree\\text{-}core} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree11PrunedSubtreeCore}_S(S,T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(S,T)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PrunedTree}_S(S)\\land\\forall R\\subseteq T\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8Subtree}_S(R,T)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree10PrunedTree}_S(R)\\to R\\subseteq S\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The core is the largest subtree of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> having no terminal nodes.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-tree10-pruned-tree","status":"resolved","id":"cd5bb3c18fda356a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-tree10-pruned-tree]